---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/16-13/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/16-13/interactions.json';
import {labels} from '../../../../lib/equipment/16-13/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/16-13/';
const rows=[
 ['BNC','50 Ω nominal, bayonet style', 'Amphenol RF 031-315 product sheet and drawing','https://www.amphenolrf.com/en-us/part/031-315/2032/','Visual and BNC signal path. Shell diameter and jacks simplified.'],
 ['SMA','8 mm hex, 50 Ω nominal','Amphenol RF 132114 outline, sheet 2','https://www.amphenolrf.com/en-us/assets/file/4065789553/','Visual only. Threads represented by rings; panels and fit inferred.'],
 ['USB-A','12.00 mm nominal plug width','USB 2.0 cables/connectors, Group 7','https://www.usb.org/sites/default/files/CabConn20.pdf','Visual only; no USB controller or enumeration.'],
 ['FFC','6 contacts, 0.50 mm pitch','Hirose FH12-6S-0.5SH(55)','https://www.hirose.com/product/p/CL0586-0582-5-55','Visual only. Original representative tongue and latch.'],
 ['Bench','244 mm tray width, 132 mm BNC jack span','Original metric design',null,'Design dimensions, not measured.'],
];
const display=x=>Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+v).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Cable and connector library" subtitle="" description="An interactive metric patch bench and ideal BNC calibration pulse route." wide={true}>
<article id="patch" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/16-13/">← Equipment 16-13</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#patch-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">16-13 / Passive connector library / Patch bench</p><h2>Cable and connector library</h2><p>Mate the virtual BNC cable and route a 1.25 V example pulse to <strong>PANEL-BNC-IN-01</strong>. Select an SMA plug with the BNC receiver to see the incompatible connection blocked.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the patch bench</h3><div id="patch-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Jack','Tray'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="patch-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div>
<canvas id="patch-model" aria-label="Orbitable passive connector bench with a movable cable end and connector samples"></canvas><p id="patch-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Click the free BNC plug to mate/unmate it, the yellow button to route the pulse, or a jack or tray sample to select it. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom. The form mirrors these controls.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Route the example</h3><form id="patch-form"><div class="e-fields">
{[['plug','Candidate plug'],['sink','Receiver']].map(([k,n])=><label>{n}<select name={k}>{Object.entries(labels).map(([v,t])=><option value={v}>{t}</option>)}</select></label>)}
<label>Bend guide (mm)<input name="radiusMm" type="range" min="8" max="50" step="1" value="30"/></label>
</div><div class="e-row"><button id="patch-mate" class="e-run" type="submit">Mate selected cable</button><button id="patch-pulse" type="button">Route example pulse</button><button id="patch-reset" type="button">Reset bench</button></div></form><p id="patch-status" role="status">No connection. Choose a plug and receiver.</p><p id="patch-bend" aria-live="polite">Demonstration bend radius: 30 mm.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Inspect the receiving channel</h3><p id="patch-result" role="status">No waveform received.</p><svg id="patch-chart" viewBox="0 0 410 207" role="img" aria-label="Receiving channel voltage in volts over five milliseconds"></svg><div class="e-row"><button id="patch-waveform" disabled>Waveform JSON</button><button id="patch-connection" disabled>Connection JSON</button></div>
<p>Open the <a href="/simulations/equipment/09-04/simulator/">Tektronix 09-04 oscilloscope</a> and import the waveform JSON to inspect the same named input. <a href={a+'example-waveform.json'}>Example waveform</a> · <a href={a+'example-connection.json'}>Example connection</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Representative connector geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original connector patch bench"/><figcaption>Original patch bench model with an unmated BNC lead.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original 3D connector shapes, lead and tray"/><figcaption>Nominal-scale connector family samples and strain relief.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Family</th><th>Geometry/specification</th><th>Reference</th><th>Scope</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(([f,v,t,url,s])=><tr><td>{f}</td><td>{v}</td><td>{url?<a href={url}>{t}</a>:t}</td><td>{s}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
<section><h3>What is modeled</h3><p>Typed endpoints permit the modeled BNC plug and BNC receiver only, with center conductor to center conductor and shield to shield. Other connector families are objects to compare; there are no adapters, triax or headstage models in this pass. Any connector or bend-guide change clears the link. The 20 mm bend warning is an original teaching limit, not a connector or cable rating.</p>
<p>Without a valid edge no signal arrives. On a valid edge, a synthetic waveform passes through unchanged: 51 samples at 0.1 ms, including ten samples at 1.25 V. “50 Ω” identifies the chosen connector family, not a fitted impedance or termination model. There is no RF loss, delay, loading, protocol emulation, hardware connection or safety certification. JSON includes named endpoints, sample and revision IDs, route warning, and modeled provenance.</p></section>
<section id="patch-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'connector-bench.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named interaction targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles, {m.draws} draw primitives and metric coordinates; optional WebXR access, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/16-13/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#patch header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#patch h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#patch section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#patch button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#patch button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#patch-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#patch-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#patch table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#patch td,#patch th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#patch figure{margin:0}#patch img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#patch caption{text-align:left}#patch input,#patch select,#patch button{min-width:0}#patch .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}</style>
